Subject: [PATCH] v2: implement the capability VM and cost model with
 differential tests

Extract this concern so its mechanism can be reviewed and measured independently.
No source semantics are added or removed by this history operation.

Original patch rationale (describes the unsplit source, not every extracted part):
Add the Lotus V2 virtual machine (including 128-bit arithmetic, LOG/SQRT,
MERKLEROOT, and CHECKDATASIG profiles 0..3 with strict prime-subgroup Ed25519),
linear compute unit (CU) cost model, and ordinary transaction validation.

